---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="Apple Health MCP Docs — setup for Claude & Cursor | health4.ai"
  description="Docs hub for Apple Health MCP: ~15-minute Apple Health → Supabase → MCP setup for Claude and Cursor, tools reference, and comparisons vs Health Auto Export."
>
  <nav class="flex items-center justify-between px-6 py-5 max-w-5xl mx-auto">
    <a href="/" class="text-green-400 font-bold text-lg tracking-tight hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity">health4.ai</a>
    <div class="flex gap-6 text-sm text-neutral-500">
      <a href="/setup/" class="hover:text-neutral-300 transition-colors">Setup</a>
      <a href="/mcp-tools/" class="hover:text-neutral-300 transition-colors hidden sm:inline">MCP tools</a>
      <a href="/compare/" class="hover:text-neutral-300 transition-colors hidden sm:inline">Compare</a>
      <a href="/" class="hover:text-neutral-300 transition-colors">Home</a>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <main class="px-6 py-12 max-w-5xl mx-auto">
    <div class="mb-14 max-w-2xl">
      <div class="text-green-500 text-xs font-mono mb-3 tracking-widest uppercase">Documentation</div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Apple Health MCP docs</h1>
      <p class="text-neutral-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
        Everything you need to run Apple Health MCP with health4.ai — from a verified ~15-minute HealthKit → your Supabase → local MCP path for Claude and Cursor, to the tools reference and honest comparisons.
      </p>
    </div>

    <section class="mb-16 grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
      <a href="/setup/" class="block border border-neutral-800 rounded-lg p-6 bg-neutral-900/40 hover:border-green-900/50 transition-colors">
        <div class="text-green-400 text-xs font-mono mb-2 uppercase tracking-wider">Start here</div>
        <h2 class="text-white font-semibold text-base mb-2">Apple Health → Supabase → MCP setup</h2>
        <p class="text-neutral-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Verified ~15-minute path: Supabase/Postgres → schema → edge function → App Store download → MCP for Claude/Cursor → verify tools.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/mcp-tools/" class="block border border-neutral-800 rounded-lg p-6 bg-neutral-900/40 hover:border-green-900/50 transition-colors">
        <div class="text-green-400 text-xs font-mono mb-2 uppercase tracking-wider">Reference</div>
        <h2 class="text-white font-semibold text-base mb-2">MCP tools</h2>
        <p class="text-neutral-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">All 11 FastMCP tools: signatures, return shapes, and example prompts.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/compare/" class="block border border-neutral-800 rounded-lg p-6 bg-neutral-900/40 hover:border-green-900/50 transition-colors">
        <div class="text-green-400 text-xs font-mono mb-2 uppercase tracking-wider">Positioning</div>
        <h2 class="text-white font-semibold text-base mb-2">Apple Health MCP vs alternatives</h2>
        <p class="text-neutral-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Own-DB + MCP vs Health Auto Export same-WiFi TCP, neiltron export+npx MCP, ChatGPT Health, and more.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/how-it-works/" class="block border border-neutral-800 rounded-lg p-6 bg-neutral-900/40 hover:border-green-900/50 transition-colors">
        <div class="text-green-400 text-xs font-mono mb-2 uppercase tracking-wider">Architecture</div>
        <h2 class="text-white font-semibold text-base mb-2">How it works</h2>
        <p class="text-neutral-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">HealthKit → your Supabase → local MCP → Claude, Cursor, and any MCP client.</p>
      </a>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-16 max-w-2xl">
      <h2 class="text-white font-semibold text-sm mb-4 uppercase tracking-widest">GitHub guides</h2>
      <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm">
        <li>
          <a href="https://github.com/jefflitt1/health4ai/blob/main/docs/SETUP.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-green-400 hover:underline">docs/SETUP.md</a>
          <span class="text-neutral-500"> — full setup detail (schema, edge function, MCP env, verify)</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://github.com/jefflitt1/health4ai/blob/main/docs/TESTFLIGHT-BETA.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-green-400 hover:underline">docs/TESTFLIGHT-BETA.md</a>
          <span class="text-neutral-500">: historical TestFlight tester-isolation notes from the pre-launch beta</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="border-t border-neutral-800/60 px-6 py-8 mt-12">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-neutral-600 text-xs">
      <span>© 2026 health4.ai · Not a medical device</span>
      <div class="flex gap-6">
        <a href="/setup/" class="hover:text-neutral-400 transition-colors">Setup</a>
        <a href="/privacy/" class="hover:text-neutral-400 transition-colors">Privacy</a>
        <a href="/terms/" class="hover:text-neutral-400 transition-colors">Terms</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/jefflitt1/health4ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="hover:text-neutral-400 transition-colors">GitHub →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>
</Layout>
